; layouts/full-fledged — the "full-fledged hledger" convention: an all.journal
; that declares everything and includes one file per year.
;
; The root is called `all.journal` rather than `main.journal`, which is the
; whole point of having this tree: nothing may recognise a root by its name.

account assets:bank:checking
account equity:opening balances
account expenses:rent
account income:salary
commodity $1,000.00

include 2017.journal
include 2018.journal
